{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Preserve Life",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use your Channel Divinity to heal the badly injured.</p><p>As an Action, you present your holy symbol and evoke healing energy that can restore a number of hit points equal to five times your cleric level. Choose any creatures within 30 feet of you, and divide those hit points among them. You can't use this feature on an undead or a construct.</p>",
